__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
# snapshots and verification runs made while trying things out; the committed
# experiment outputs under experiments/outputs/ ARE tracked, deliberately
*.seal.npz
# ...except the published reference, which is the half of the product that travels:
# verifying an endpoint needs no weights, so the seal is what someone else needs
!reference-seals/*.seal.npz
scratch/
